[37.864242, "o", "  The Teraflex is a much larger device: \u001b[1m330 YANG models\u001b[0m, \u001b[1m13,281 telemetry paths\u001b[0m.\r\n  It also has PM and FEC-BER telemetry — real optical performance data.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mSetup takes ~40s for this many models, so it was run beforehand.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
